<h1 data-copy-en="Gruff" data-copy-zh="Gruff">Gruff</h1>
<p class="starter-description" data-copy-en="The guard captain’s patrol schedule and shared daily Talk limit." data-copy-zh="卫队长的巡逻时间与共用交谈额度。">The guard captain’s patrol schedule and shared daily Talk limit.</p>
<div class="wiki-source-line"><span data-copy-en="v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026" data-copy-zh="v1.0_BETAx · 2026 年 11 月 9 日更新">v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026</span></div></div></section>
<section class="section wiki-reading-section"><div class="container wiki-reading-layout">
<aside class="wiki-toc"><div class="wiki-toc-inner"><button aria-expanded="false" class="wiki-toc-toggle" data-wiki-toc-toggle="" type="button"><span data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</span><span aria-hidden="true">+</span></button><p class="wiki-toc-heading" data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</p><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="en" data-wiki-toc-links=""><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-overview">Overview</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-location">Where to find Gruff</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-route">Route and relationship milestones</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-activities">Activities and rewards</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-troubleshooting">Missing actions and useful checks</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-related">Related guides</a></div><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="zh" data-wiki-toc-links="" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-overview">概览</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-location">出现地点与时间</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-route">路线与关系进展</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-activities">行动与奖励</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-troubleshooting">动作缺失时的检查</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-related">相关指南</a></div></div></aside>
<article class="wiki-article"><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-en" data-lang-panel="en" lang="en"><section id="en-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Optional_Private-Client_Bookings"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="The_Captain.27s_Security_Audit"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="The_Captain's_Security_Audit"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Recommended_Walkthrough"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Overview"></span><h2>Overview</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="View full screenshot: Gruff — character portrait." href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/gruff.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Gruff — character portrait." decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/gruff.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Gruff — character portrait.</figcaption></figure><p>Gruff moves around Kings Demesne on a fixed patrol. His current personal action is Talk; he is not a trainer, shop or recruitable worker.</p></section>
<section id="en-location"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Where_to_Find_Gruff"></span><h2>Where to find Gruff</h2><p>Travel to Medieval → Kings Demesne and choose the patrol location below. Noble Quarter is a late, odd-day appearance; arriving there every evening will not always find him.</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Location</th><th scope="col">Portrait schedule</th><th scope="col">Condition</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Merchants Quarter</th><td data-label="Portrait schedule">09:00–14:00</td><td data-label="Condition"></td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Grand Bazaar</th><td data-label="Portrait schedule">15:00–19:00</td><td data-label="Condition"></td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Noble Quarter</th><td data-label="Portrait schedule">odd days, 21:00–24:00</td><td data-label="Condition"></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Windows refer to the time you start an action; the ending time is excluded.</p></section>
<section id="en-route"><h2>Route and relationship milestones</h2><p>There is no separate personal quest or heart-to-heart chain on Gruff’s current action list. Ordinary conversations improve the relationship, while supporting appearances are reached through their own events. His favored Iron Will skill does not mean he teaches it.</p></section>
<section id="en-activities"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Performance_Stage_Reaction"></span><h2>Activities and rewards</h2><p>Talk to Gruff takes 15 minutes,+1 base relationship and allows 4 safe uses per game day. All three patrol locations use the same Talk allowance. The shared relationship modifiers can change the displayed gain.</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Location / start window</th><th scope="col">Requirements</th><th scope="col">Base cost / recovery</th><th scope="col">Result / limit</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Talk to Gruff</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Merchants Quarter; 09:00–14:00<br/>Grand Bazaar; 15:00–19:00<br/>Noble Quarter; odd days, 21:00–24:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Stranger (0)</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">15 min</td><td data-label="Result / limit">4 safe uses/day</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section>
<section id="en-troubleshooting"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Troubleshooting"></span><h2>Missing actions and useful checks</h2><p>Check the gap 14:00–15:00, the evening gap 19:00–21:00 and the odd-day restriction at the Noble Quarter before assuming Gruff has disappeared. Following him to the next patrol stop does not restore used Talk attempts.</p></section>
<section id="en-related"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Related_Pages"></span><h2>Related guides</h2><p><a href="locations.html">Locations and travel</a> · <a href="game-systems-relationships-dating-and-intimacy.html">Relationship modifiers</a> · <a href="game-systems-story-beats.html">Story progression</a></p></section>
</div><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-zh" data-lang-panel="zh" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><section id="zh-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Optional_Private-Client_Bookings"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-The_Captain.27s_Security_Audit"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-The_Captain's_Security_Audit"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Recommended_Walkthrough"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Overview"></span><h2>概览</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="查看完整截图：Gruff 的角色头像。" href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/gruff.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Gruff 的角色头像。" decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/gruff.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Gruff 的角色头像。</figcaption></figure><p>Gruff按固定巡逻时间在国王领地移动，当前个人动作是交谈，不提供训练、商店或员工招募服务。</p></section>
<section id="zh-location"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Where_to_Find_Gruff"></span><h2>出现地点与时间</h2><p>前往中世纪 → 国王领地，再按下表选择巡逻地点。贵族区是单数日深夜行程，不是每天傍晚都能找到他。</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">地点</th><th scope="col">头像出现时间</th><th scope="col">条件</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">商人区</th><td data-label="头像出现时间">09:00–14:00</td><td data-label="条件"></td></tr><tr><th scope="row">大集市</th><td data-label="头像出现时间">15:00–19:00</td><td data-label="条件"></td></tr><tr><th scope="row">贵族区</th><td data-label="头像出现时间">单数日，21:00–24:00</td><td data-label="条件"></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>时段按开始动作时判定，结束时间不包含在内。</p></section>
<section id="zh-route"><h2>路线与关系进展</h2><p>Gruff当前动作列表没有独立个人任务链或谈心链，可通过普通交谈培养关系，辅助出场则按各自事件推进。他偏好的钢铁意志技能，也不代表能向他学习。</p></section>
<section id="zh-activities"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Performance_Stage_Reaction"></span><h2>行动与奖励</h2><p>交谈耗15分钟、基础关系+1，每个游戏日安全额度4次，三个巡逻地点共用。实际显示增加量仍受共用关系加成影响。</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">动作</th><th scope="col">地点／开始时段</th><th scope="col">条件</th><th scope="col">基础消耗／恢复</th><th scope="col">结果／限制</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">和 Gruff 交谈</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">商人区; 09:00–14:00<br/>大集市; 15:00–19:00<br/>贵族区; 单数日，21:00–24:00</td><td data-label="条件">陌生人（0）</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">15分钟</td><td data-label="结果／限制">4次／日安全额度</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section>
<section id="zh-troubleshooting"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Troubleshooting"></span><h2>动作缺失时的检查</h2><p>找不到时先检查14:00—15:00和19:00—21:00的空档，以及贵族区的单数日限制。跟着他去下一个巡逻点，不会恢复已经用掉的交谈次数。</p></section>
<section id="zh-related"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Related_Pages"></span><h2>相关指南</h2><p><a href="locations.html">地点与移动</a> · <a href="game-systems-relationships-dating-and-intimacy.html">关系加成</a> · <a href="game-systems-story-beats.html">主线进度</a></p></section>
